# Disabled checks do not fit this C codebase:
# - casting-through-void: the suggested C++ cast forms do not apply in C.
# - no-int-to-ptr: Win32 passes pointers as LPARAM and LONG_PTR.
# - DeprecatedOrUnsafeBufferHandling: wants Annex K memcpy_s, which glibc,
#   musl and Apple libc do not provide.
# - EnumCastOutOfRange: D3D12 and Vulkan flag enums combine their values.
# - avoid-pragma-once: every supported compiler implements #pragma once.
# Reserved names that the platform defines: feature-test macros and the
# no-CRT _fltused symbol.
Checks: >
  -*,
  bugprone-*,
  clang-analyzer-*,
  performance-*,
  portability-*,
  -bugprone-easily-swappable-parameters,
  -bugprone-casting-through-void,
  -performance-no-int-to-ptr,
  -portability-avoid-pragma-once,
  -clang-analyzer-security.insecureAPI.DeprecatedOrUnsafeBufferHandling,
  -clang-analyzer-optin.core.EnumCastOutOfRange
CheckOptions:
  bugprone-reserved-identifier.AllowedIdentifiers: '_POSIX_C_SOURCE;_DARWIN_C_SOURCE;_fltused'
WarningsAsErrors: '*'
HeaderFilterRegex: 'src[/\\].*'
FormatStyle: file
